cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CGeV: Comparative Gene Viewer"
message: "If you use CGeV, cite this software version and the associated manuscript when available."
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-24
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/raulrojas22/CGeV"
repository-code: "https://github.com/raulrojas22/CGeV"
abstract: >-
  Comparative Gene Viewer (CGeV) is an interactive R/Shiny web application for
  gene-centered structural comparison and functional context across species. It
  combines local indexed genomes, annotations, and Gene Ontology resources with
  optional public services to support multi-gene and cross-species comparison,
  sequence alignment and extraction, analytical summaries, and figure export.
keywords:
  - comparative genomics
  - gene visualization
  - shiny
  - gene ontology
  - bioinformatics
